**独立参考解答（非原书摘录）**

将每个雨点作为一个动态结点，并把其生命期实现为有限状态机：`FALL`（下落）、`SPLASH`（落水声）和 `RIPPLE`（同心圆扩散）。图形库和声音库不由题目指定，以下将 `DrawDrop`、`DrawCircle`、`PlaySplash` 抽象为平台适配函数；状态转换和数据管理不依赖某个特定界面。

~~~c
typedef enum { FALL, SPLASH, RIPPLE } DropState;
typedef struct Drop {
    int x, y, waterY, color, maxRadius, radius;
    unsigned long nextTick;
    DropState state;
    struct Drop *next;
} Drop;

Drop *CreateDrop(unsigned long now) {
    Drop *d = malloc(sizeof *d);
    d->x = Rand(0, ScreenWidth - 1);
    d->waterY = Rand(WaterTop, WaterBottom);
    d->y = Rand(SkyTop, d->waterY - 1);
    d->color = Rand(0, ColorCount - 1);
    d->maxRadius = Rand(MinRadius, MaxRadius);
    d->radius = 0; d->state = FALL; d->nextTick = now + FallTick;
    return d;
}

/* 返回 true 表示结点生命期结束，可由调用者摘链并 free。 */
bool Advance(Drop *d, unsigned long now) {
    if (d->state == FALL) {
        d->y += FallSpeed;
        if (d->y < d->waterY) { DrawDrop(d->x, d->y, d->color, now); d->nextTick = now + FallTick; }
        else { d->y = d->waterY; d->state = SPLASH; d->nextTick = now; }
    } else if (d->state == SPLASH) {
        PlaySplash(d->x, d->waterY, d->color);
        d->state = RIPPLE; d->radius = 1; d->nextTick = now + RippleTick;
    } else {
        DrawCircle(d->x, d->waterY, d->radius, d->color);
        d->radius += RippleStep;
        if (d->radius > d->maxRadius) return true;
        d->nextTick = now + RippleTick;
    }
    return false;
}
~~~

主循环维护当前结点链表和 `nextBirth`：当 `now >= nextBirth` 时创建新雨点并令 `nextBirth = now + Rand(MinGap,MaxGap)`；遍历链表，更新所有到期结点并在涟漪结束后安全删除；最后重绘背景与所有仍存活结点。`MinGap` 必须为正，随机区间必须合法；窗口缩放时重新约束 `x` 和水面坐标。遍历时使用 `pre,p`，删除后令 `p=pre->next`，避免跳过相邻雨点。

不变式是每个存活结点恰处于一个阶段且 `nextTick` 是它下一次状态变化的时刻，链表只含尚未消失的雨点。因此可以同时显示任意多个独立雨点。每帧更新时间为 O(k)、空间为 O(k)，k 为当前存活雨点数；单个雨点的更新次数由其下落距离和最大半径决定。

